// W5-24 U3a/t, S-484 (spec §6.5: "`@fp` に属性を付けないときと同じ意味を名指す値（`@fp(strict)`、§15.5
// の既定）と、属性で選べない浮動小数のプロファイルの名前（`@fp(strict-ftz)`）は、同じ E0005 で、修正候補は属性を除くことである"): `@ fp(strict)`, with a space after the `@` (§2.5):
// the E0005 of the value is reported and the candidate takes out the space with the attribute. The candidate takes the attribute
// out, and the file has no error left after it (`clean`, S-253). The main position is the attribute. A file with one unit, so that
// `clean` looks at the whole file.

@ fp(strict)                                        //~ E0005
pub fn h(x: F32) -> F32 {
  x * 2.0
}
